%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
/s { length r } def
/e { stopped b } def
(Hello World) (World) search b s s s
(Hello World) (zz) search b s
(Hello World) (Hell) anchorsearch b s s
(Hello World) (World) anchorsearch b s
() (x) anchorsearch b s
(abc) () search b s s s
{ 1 (x) search } e { (x) 1 anchorsearch } e
